<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">for the hope of it all (&amp;amp; what I knew at seventeen)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;â€œThe worst thing that I ever did,â€ Catra swallows the words as they bubble in her throat, her gaze split between Adoraâ€™s opal eyes and her grip on the door knob whitening, â€œwas what I did to you.â€&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;As the thrill of summer turns fades into the worst autumn in her life, Catra is ready to admit she doesn't know anything at seventeen years old. Catra didn't know how much she would regret getting in the first car that drove up during the first fight with her best friend turned girlfriend Adora. Catra didn't know (because she never called) that Adora switching homerooms could feel so much like her own fault, that this exile could feel so much like a curse. Catra doesn't know anything- except that she misses Adora, and loves her like she's always loved her. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Or, Adora throwing a party gives Catra one last chance to mend the string of fate that binds them together and change the ending to this story- if Adora doesn't slam the door in her face for being so bold as to show up, that is. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;~an experimental she ra folklorian au inspired by the question â€œis betty by taylor swift a catradora song?â€&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>ceruleanstorm</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
      <dc:subject>
        <rdf:Bag>
          <rdf:li>Fanworks</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>She-Ra and the Princesses of Power (2018)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora/Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>mentions of</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow/Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma/Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista/Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Hope/Mara (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Catra (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Adora (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Glimmer (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Bow (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Micah (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Razz (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mara (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Double Trouble (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Sea Hawk (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mermista (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Frosta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Mentions of - Character</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Shadow Weaver | Light Spinner (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Horde Prime (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Scorpia (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Angella (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Entrapta (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Wrong Hordak (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Perfuma (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Light Hope (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Swift Wind | Spirit</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Melog (She-Ra)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Selena (OC)</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Modern AU</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>a folklorian au</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>set in the 90's</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>based on folklore and evermore by Taylor Swift</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Inspired by a Tumblr Ask</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>can still be read even if you're not into Taylor Swift</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>an experimental fic</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>a treat for catradora stans who are also TS stans</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>F/F</rdf:li>
